00:01:01,260 --> 00:01:02,680 [speaker_0]
Yeah. They're very social.

00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:02,940 [speaker_1]
Yeah. Very social.

00:01:04,540 --> 00:01:13,000 [speaker_0]
Um, and what do you think... This kind of links to the first question, but what makes it hard to approach other students if you were gonna approach someone?

00:01:13,040 --> 00:01:18,520 [speaker_1]
Mm. I feel like if they have headphones or they're looking at their phones- ... they're very busy or talking on their phones. But also their atmosphere, too. Like, if they look friendly enough, kind enough. And also sometimes gender kind of has- ... an impact on me. If they're, like, really tall, muscular- ... big man, I'll be a little bit scared of talking to them.

00:01:36,420 --> 00:01:37,500 [speaker_0]
Yeah. That's fair enough.
 
00:01:38,160 --> 00:01:43,720 [speaker_0]
Um, and what do you think would make it easier for you to build friendships
or find community at uni?

00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:45,760 [speaker_1]
