00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:25,800 [speaker_0]
Good. Um, and what do you think is currently lacking from finding friends through, like, clubs or uni events?

00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:29,060 [speaker_1]
Mm. Like, problems, you mean?

00:02:29,160 --> 00:02:31,520 [speaker_0]
Yeah. Yeah, like the problems, current problems.

00:02:31,680 --> 00:02:40,440 [speaker_1]
Mm. Current problems. I would say the hard to, uh... the difficulty to make it consistent and lasting. So even if you go to one event, if you don't go to the other, it's gonna be harder to, like, go back to that flow- ... and like have a long-lasting friendship. So I would say, like, the time.

00:02:53,900 --> 00:03:00,360 [speaker_0]
Okay. Um, and are you someone that prefers connecting one-on-one or in groups?

00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:03,500 [speaker_1]
